WEBVTT

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:09.208
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Would you like to come to the match with me on Sunday?

00:00:19.686 --> 00:00:21.290
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> Yes, I’d love to.

00:00:31.191 --> 00:00:33.680
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Let’s meet at half past three.

00:00:43.728 --> 00:00:44.561
<v><b>Alan:</b></v> See you there.

00:00:54.814 --> 00:00:56.940
<v><b>Rob:</b></v> Would you like a burger?

00:01:06.846 --> 00:01:09.767
How about a coffee?

00:01:19.635 --> 00:01:22.368
<v><b>Steve:</b></v> I’d like to ask you something.

00:01:32.877 --> 00:01:34.920
<v><b>Jenny:</b></v> I don’t think it’s a good idea.